    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "This is another demo showcase for an indie project.\nIt\u2019s built on
    top of the FPS build, but this version is more focused on showing off the Grenade
    Machine. Everything here is still work-in-progress\u2014VFX, zombie animations,
    and gameplay elements are not final. This is just a demo build for testing and
    feedback.\n\nControls:\n\nWASD \u2013 Move\n\nShift \u2013 Sprint\n\nLeft Click
    \u2013 Shoot\n\nRight Click \u2013 Aim\n\n1 \u2013 Switch guns\n\nR \u2013 Reload\n\nC
    \u2013 Slide (jump into a slide to activate Kinetic Jump, and from Kinetic Jump
    you can slam back down by clicking SPACE)\n\nE \u2013 Interact\n\nAt a Magic
    Station, press E to pick a magic ability, then press Q to summon it. (Magic cooldowns
    are temporary and not final.)\n\nQ \u2013 Summon Magic\n\nG - Throw Grenade"
